{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000186","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000186"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000186","label":"太師疵","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"太師疵","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0023"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0023","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p014","quote":"太師疵"}],"identity_note":"依《周本紀》特定敘事建立；稱號與未見本名不補造，不按同名全庫合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"太師疵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000186","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p014","text":"居二年，聞紂昏亂暴虐滋甚，殺王子比干，囚箕子。太師疵、少師彊抱其樂器而奔周。於是武王遍告諸侯曰：「殷有重罪，不可以不畢伐。」乃遵文王，遂率戎車三百乘，虎賁三千人，甲士四萬五千人，以東伐紂。十一年十二月戊午，師畢渡盟津，諸侯咸會。曰：「孳孳無怠！」武王乃作《太誓》，告于眾庶：「今殷王紂乃用其婦人之言，自絕于天，毀壞其三正，離逖其王父母弟，乃斷棄其先祖之樂，乃為淫聲，用變亂正聲，怡說婦人。故今予發維共行天罰。勉哉夫子，不可再，不可三！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000136","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0014","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"王子比干","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000147","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000151","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"太師疵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000186","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m014-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"少師彊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000187","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m01